==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Doge]]s spawn after 2 seconds<sup>60f</sup>, delay 10~16.67 seconds<sup>300f~500f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Snache]]s spawn after 6 seconds<sup>180f</sup>, delay 13.33~20 seconds<sup>400f~600f</sup>.
*3 [[Those Guys]] spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>.
*3 [[Those Guys]] spawn after 22 seconds<sup>660f</sup>, delay 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>.
*3 [[Those Guys]] spawn after 24 seconds<sup>720f</sup>, delay 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>.
*1 [[Gory]] spawns after 60 seconds<sup>1,800f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 90% HP:
**1 [[Mob Cat (Enemy)|Mob Cat]] spawns as the boss.
**20 [[Doge]]s spawn, delay 3.33~6.67 seconds<sup>100f~200f</sup>.

==Strategy==
A very easy stage that any unit can beat. Bring any of the [[:Category:Normal Cats|Normal Cats]] to win.

